    metaTitle: 'Healthcare Software Development Canada: Buyer Guide',
    metaDescription: 'Plan healthcare software development in Canada: compare project types, privacy and data residency questions, EHR integration, scope and vendor selection.',
    answer: 'Canadian healthcare software development is the design, building and integration of digital tools for care providers, patients and health organizations, with clinical workflows, privacy, security and interoperability planned from the start.',
